        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nNormal stress:   σ = F_normal / A    [Pa = N/m²]\nShear stress:    τ = F_shear  / A    [Pa]\nBearing stress:  σ_b = F / A_bearing  (projected area)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
