        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "structural",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[mechanics, of]",
        "section": "structural",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "02 - Mechanics of Materials",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Engineering strain (small deformations):**\n```\nNormal: ε = δ/L₀ = (L − L₀)/L₀   (dimensionless)\nShear:  γ = angular change [rad]   (shear strain)"
    },
    {
