      "text": "### Material Constants"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:structural:02-mechanics-of-materials, git-history:structural:02-mechanics-of-materials]",
        "canonical_path": "structural/02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md",
        "concepts": "[mechanics, of, materials]",
        "current_path": "structural/02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md",
        "id": "maxim:structural:mechanics-of-materials",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "structural",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[mechanics, of]",
        "section": "structural",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "02 - Mechanics of Materials",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nYoung's modulus:  E = σ/ε  [Pa]        (resistance to normal deformation)\nShear modulus:    G = τ/γ  [Pa]        (resistance to shear)\nBulk modulus:     K = −p/e  [Pa]       (resistance to volume change)\nPoisson's ratio:  ν = −ε_lat/ε_axial   (lateral contraction per axial extension)"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md#013",
      "path": [
        "02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:structural:02-mechanics-of-materials, git-history:structural:02-mechanics-of-materials]",
        "canonical_path": "structural/02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md",
        "concepts": "[mechanics, of, materials]",
        "current_path": "structural/02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md",
        "id": "maxim:structural:mechanics-of-materials",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "structural",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[mechanics, of]",
        "section": "structural",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "02 - Mechanics of Materials",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Relation: G = E / [2(1+ν)]     K = E / [3(1−2ν)]\nTypical for steel: E = 200 GPa, G = 77 GPa, ν = 0.30\nTypical for Al:    E = 70 GPa,  G = 26 GPa, ν = 0.33\nConcrete:          E = 30 GPa,  ν ≈ 0.2 (elastic range only)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md#014",
      "path": [
        "02-MECHANICS-OF-MATERIALS.md"
      ],
